---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyProject
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard3 --> q_guard4: whenTokensNotSupplied
    q_guard4 --> q_verifySupply: _verifyCanSupplyTokens(amount)
    q_verifySupply --> q_calcTotal: totalRequired = amount + legionFee + referrerFee
    q_calcTotal --> q_transfer: safeTransferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_transfer --> q_sendLegionFee: safeTransfer(legionFeeReceiver, legionFee)
    q_sendLegionFee --> q_sendReferrerFee: safeTransfer(referrerFeeDistributor, referrerFee)
    q_sendReferrerFee --> q_markSupplied: s_saleStatus.tokensSupplied = true
    q_markSupplied --> q_emit: emit TokensSuppliedForDistribution(amount, legionFee, referrerFee)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_guard4
        INV-001: Tokens can only be supplied once per sale
        INV-002: Project must approve the sale contract for totalRequired tokens
    end note

    note right of q_verifySupply
        INV-003: amount must match expected allocation from published TGE details
        INV-004: Fee tokens sent directly to receivers, not held by sale contract
    end note
